    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Race a tiny skateboard through tracks of cardboard and toys. Uncover shortcuts and perform stunts to reach the goal as fast as possible in this celebration of speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999500/extras/862a3ae678f837a7b4af61a627b1939a.webp?t=1753718420\" width=1 height=20 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999500/extras/a86dcf0aa800558780c73e7e04854062.poster.avif?t=1753718420\" width=620 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999500/extras/a86dcf0aa800558780c73e7e04854062.webm?t=1753718420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Race through skate-infused parcours as fast as possible!</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Replay and perfect your runs to earn medals, unlocking more rooms in your home featuring new levels and abilities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999500/extras/53ff724b6f727a1189edf96f3bc1f9fe.webp?t=1753718420\" width=1 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999500/extras/035cdf42b61313b5a71d885282686139.poster.avif?t=1753718420\" width=620 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999500/extras/035cdf42b61313b5a71d885282686139.webm?t=1753718420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Climb <strong>online leaderboards</strong> for each level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Beat your friends' scores to challenge them.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999500/extras/53ff724b6f727a1189edf96f3bc1f9fe.webp?t=1753718420\" width=1 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999500/extras/3f06c392ae6b7a59a2601c92a3b39594.poster.avif?t=1753718420\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999500/extras/3f06c392ae6b7a59a2601c92a3b39594.webm?t=1753718420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Perform big leaps, grinds and flips to boost through childhood memories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Control gravity to dive mid-air or dash downhill.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999500/extras/53ff724b6f727a1189edf96f3bc1f9fe.webp?t=1753718420\" width=1 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999500/extras/eb63b65b5d2427d69c86304899f7dc66.poster.avif?t=1753718420\" width=620 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2999500/extras/eb63b65b5d2427d69c86304899f7dc66.webm?t=1753718420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Explore and search for shortcuts while finding collectibles along the way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Skate as fast as you can manage \u2013 There is no speed limit!</p></li></ul>",
